ning late.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_13","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_14","text":"That might be the case, but","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_15","text":"if she is late, she usually lets me know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_16","text":"Maybe she just forgot.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_17","text":"What?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_18","text":"That's concerning...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_19","text":"We were supposed to run through our moves for the upcoming performance.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_20","text":"It's two days from now, so we don't have a lot of time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_21","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_22","text":"Ah-hah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_23","text":"Pit Boss.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_24","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"noir","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_noir_02_25","text":"Are you busy right now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_noir_02_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"L